            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case is reported of a patient with an asymmetric septate uterus and menstrual retention in the blind cavity localized on the right side of the septum. A review is made of the literature about this rare malformation first described by Robert, is made.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
